{
  "id": "FZ-005",
  "api": "dex2oat-once toolchain (dex2oat-once T7): host dex2oat64 (T3c, r1 tree + 22-patch series, explicit suspend-check / implicit_suspend_checks_=false) + t5_gen_image.sh generator that produce a board-R155-compatible 27-file boot image offline; verified image-only (T5c/T6c) and image+stubs-jar package (T7c). Freezes the toolchain that regenerates boot classes (tagsoup, MediaStore, boot-api stubs) without a decommissioned build machine.",
